        "content": "**Missing is not zero.** Gaps and query errors require investigation; system-event counts do not measure uptime or failures. Queue depth is not throughput; outgoing is broker delivery, not successful processing. Incoming/outgoing are observed totals, not unique events across stages.\n\nWorkbook summaries retain fixed seven-day filters and original formulas. Storage uses the Workbook division by 1024\u00b3 and rounding to three decimals (small real values can round to zero). The consumed/provisioned-RU Workbook query returned no rows and is preserved in the query catalogue, not shown as a fabricated panel.\n\nManual refresh avoids background queries. Existing Analytics tables, identity, workspace, retention and Grafana hosting are reused; metric API usage and active hosting can still contribute to existing charges. No new instrumentation, resources, alerts or permissions."
      }
